## AWS Serverless Contact Management System

A serverless contact management web application built using Amazon API Gateway, AWS Lambda, Amazon DynamoDB, IAM, and HTML/CSS/JavaScript.

The application allows users to submit their contact information through a web form. The request is sent to an API Gateway endpoint, processed by a Python-based AWS Lambda function, and stored in an Amazon DynamoDB table.

 ## 🚀  Project Overview

This project demonstrates how to build and integrate a simple serverless application on AWS without managing traditional servers.

Key Features
Responsive contact form using HTML and CSS
JavaScript-based API integration
REST API using Amazon API Gateway
Python backend using AWS Lambda
Contact data persistence using Amazon DynamoDB
IAM-based Lambda permissions
CORS configuration for frontend/API communication
Error handling and input validation
CloudWatch logging for debugging and monitoring
UUID-based unique ID generation for database records
